:: dial stage 1
/*https://stackoverflow.com/questions/5182170/how-to-let-an-html-image-overlap-another */
<img src="src/assets/img/HeaterTutorial_dial1.png" width="320" height="auto" alt="[alt text goes here]" style="border: 1px solid #f00;
  position:relative;z-index: 2;"/>
<img src="src/assets/img/HeaterTutorial_gauge1.png"  width="320" height="auto" alt="[alt text goes here]" style = "border: 1px solid #0f0;
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
  top: -215px;"/>

  [[^^ increase temp|dial stage 2]]
  vv decrease temp

